# WordPress pattern-first

Follow the personal skill **wordpress-pattern-first** (`~/.cursor/skills/wordpress-pattern-first/SKILL.md`) for all WordPress theme / Gutenberg / pattern work.

**Also obey always-on rule `cms-ui-fidelity`:** editor canvas = front UI 100%.

- Prefer unsynced patterns + core blocks + block styles (Admin edits text/images/buttons/links).
- Custom blocks only: forms (`soul/lead-form`), ATC (`soul/add-to-cart`), hero video/overlay, tabs, CPT queries, hard templateLock.
- No `page-*.php` HTML clones; no one custom block per SCSS file; **no marketing `wp:html`**.
- Fidelity via className `s-home-*` / surface styles on Group/Columns + shared CSS (CMS = UI).
- Update `PATTERN-SYSTEM/` catalogs when adding patterns or blocks in this repo.
